ce=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></div></div></div>, <p></p>the relation is \n<div id=\"selectList-212208-2\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-212208-2\" style=\"width: 218px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">neither reflexive nor irreflexive</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 467px; top: 21869px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">irreflexive</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">both reflexive and irreflexive</div><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">neither reflexive nor irreflexive</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">reflexive</div></div></div>.</div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>A binary relation <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"337\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mj